 · a narrow alley","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s860","en":"The brochure tends to exaggerate how close the hotel is to town.","zh":"宣传册往往夸大酒店离镇中心有多近。","note":"exaggerate · 夸大， 夸张 · exaggerate a claim","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s861","en":"The students began to discover patterns in the survey responses.","zh":"学生们开始在问卷回答中发现规律。","note":"discover · 发现， 找到； 发觉 · discover a pattern","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s862","en":"The vet examined our cat while we waited outside.","zh":"我们在外面等候时，兽医检查了我们的猫。","note":"vet · 审查，仔细检查；兽医 · consult a vet","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s863","en":"Income from the café helps offset the museum's running costs.","zh":"咖啡馆的收入帮助抵消博物馆的运营费用。","note":"offset · 抵消， 补偿， 弥补 · offset a cost","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s864","en":"A small cascade tumbled over the rocks beside the path.","zh":"一股小瀑布从小路旁的岩石上倾泻而下。","note":"cascade · 小瀑布 · a small cascade","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s865","en":"The photograph manages to capture the excitement of opening night.","zh":"这张照片成功捕捉了首演之夜的兴奋氛围。","note":"capture · 捕获，俘获；夺取或赢得；捕获； 战利品 · capture a moment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s866","en":"The course helps older learners become more confident and computer literate.","zh":"这门课帮助年长学习者更加自信，并掌握电脑技能。","note":"literate · 有读写能力的； 有文化的； 博学的 · computer literate","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s867","en":"She studied part-time to gain a qualification in garden design.","zh":"她通过非全日制学习取得了园林设计资格。","note":"qualification · 资格， 合格； 技能； 限定， 条件； 合格证 · a professional qualification","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s868","en":"Arrange the photographs in sequence before writing the captions.","zh":"写说明文字前，请先把照片按顺序排列。","note":"sequence · 一系列， 一连串； 顺序， 次序 · in sequence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s869","en":"The chemistry lesson compared complete combustion with incomplete combustion.","zh":"化学课比较了完全燃烧与不完全燃烧。","note":"combustion · 燃烧； 燃烧过程 · complete combustion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s870","en":"The council reviewed the provision of evening bus services.","zh":"市政委员会审查了夜间公交服务的供给情况。","note":"provision · 供应， 供应品； 准备， 预备； 条款， 规定； 给养， 口粮 · the provision of services","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s871","en":"The museum hopes to recruit volunteers for its summer programme.","zh":"博物馆希望为暑期项目招募志愿者。","note":"recruit · 招募，招收；复原，恢复；补充；新兵， 新成员， 新会员 · recruit volunteers","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s872","en":"Repairs will commence once the final equipment delivery arrives.","zh":"最后一批设备送达后，维修就会开始。","note":"commence · 开始， 着手 · commence work","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s873","en":"The flexible seating configuration allows both lectures and group discussions.","zh":"灵活的座位配置既适合讲座，也适合小组讨论。","note":"configuration · 结构， 配置； 轮廓， 外形 · a seating configuration","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s874","en":"The repair bill took a large chunk of our savings.","zh":"维修费花掉了我们很大一部分积蓄。","note":"chunk · 大块； 相当大的部分 · a large chunk","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s875","en":"Passengers waited on the platform as the train approached.","zh":"列车驶近时，乘客们在站台上等候。","note":"platform · 平台， 站台； 纲领 · a railway platform","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s876","en":"The archive contains newspaper reports about a historical libel case.","zh":"档案馆保存着有关一宗历史诽谤案的报纸报道。","note":"libel · 诽谤，中伤；诽谤性文字；诽谤， 中伤， 诬蔑 · a libel case","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s877","en":"Researchers examined old receipts to establish the painting's provenance.","zh":"研究人员检查旧收据，以查明这幅画的来源。","note":"provenance · 出处， 起源 · establish provenance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s878","en":"The museum displays a model of an extinct seabird.","zh":"博物馆展出了一种已灭绝海鸟的模型。","note":"extinct · 灭绝的； 废弃的 · an extinct species","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s879","en":"The mechanic inspected the rear axle of the old van.","zh":"机修工检查了旧货车的后轴。","note":"axle · 车轴， 轮轴 · a rear axle","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s880","en":"Some plastics degrade slowly when exposed to sunlight.","zh":"某些塑料在阳光照射下会缓慢降解。","note":"degrade · 降级； 堕落； 降解； 退化 · degrade over time","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s881","en":"The project aims to protect biodiversity in urban gardens.","zh":"这个项目旨在保护城市花园中的生物多样性。","note":"biodiversity · 生物多样性 · protect biodiversity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s882","en":"The bathroom window uses opaque glass to provide privacy.","zh":"浴室窗户使用不透明玻璃来保护隐私。","note":"opaque · 不透明的； 晦涩的， 难懂的 · opaque glass","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s883","en":"Living near the station has a clear advantage for commuters.","zh":"住在车站附近对通勤者有明显的好处。","note":"advantage · 优点， 优势 · a clear advantage","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s884","en":"The assistant helped visitors locate books in the archive.","zh":"助理帮助访客查找档案馆中的书籍。","note":"assistant · 助理的； · a teaching assistant","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s885","en":"The organisers did not want to overestimate demand for tickets.","zh":"组织者不想高估人们对门票的需求。","note":"overestimate · 对…估计过高[ˌəuvər'estImət]；过高的估计 · overestimate demand","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s886","en":"The humid weather made our clothes take longer to dry.","zh":"潮湿的天气让我们的衣服花更久才晾干。","note":"humid · 湿的， 潮湿的， 湿润的， 多潮气的 · a humid climate","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s887","en":"The proposed demolition caused controversy among local residents.","zh":"拟议中的拆除工程在当地居民中引起了争议。","note":"controversy · 争论， 辩论， 论战 · cause controversy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s888","en":"The introductory workshop is compulsory for all new students.","zh":"所有新生都必须参加入门工作坊。","note":"compulsory · 义务的； 必须做的； 强制性的； 必修的 · a compulsory module","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s889","en":"We did not anticipate such a long queue outside the gallery.","zh":"我们没想到画廊外会排这么长的队。","note":"anticipate · 预期， 预料， 期望； 先于…行动 · anticipate a problem","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s890","en":"You can detach the lamp from its base for storage.","zh":"你可以把灯从底座拆下，方便收纳。","note":"detach · 分开， 分离； 分遣 · detach from","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s891","en":"The shop decided to slash prices before moving premises.","zh":"商店决定在搬迁前大幅降价。","note":"slash · 砍； 大幅度削减；砍痕，伤痕；斜线号 · slash prices","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s892","en":"The advertisement tries to seduce buyers with images of luxury.","zh":"广告试图用奢华的画面吸引买家。","note":"seduce · 勾引， 引诱； 诱使， 唆使 · seduce buyers","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s893","en":"The exhibition celebrates the changing landscape of rural Yorkshire.","zh":"展览展现了约克郡乡村不断变化的景观。","note":"landscape · 风景；对…作景观美化， 美化 · a rural landscape","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s894","en":"Using the school hall is only a temporary solution.","zh":"使用学校礼堂只是一个临时解决方案。","note":"temporary · 临时的， 暂时的 · a temporary solution","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s895","en":"The survey records changes in the bird's natural habitat.","zh":"调查记录了这种鸟的自然栖息地的变化。","note":"habitat · 栖息地， 住处 · a natural habitat","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s896","en":"The organisers were desperate for extra volunteers before opening day.","zh":"开幕日前，组织者急切需要更多志愿者。","note":"desperate · 绝望的； 拼命的， 不顾一切的； 极度渴望的； 危急的 · desperate for help","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s897","en":"The awful weather forced us to abandon our picnic.","zh":"糟糕的天气迫使我们放弃野餐。","note":"awful · 糟糕的 · awful weather","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-05:s898","en":"Keep a notebook handy when interviewing the older residents.","zh":"采访年长居民时，把笔记本放在手边。"